metadata/_sms_note = "Pass 147: the Bullet Bill (TKiller). The Monty Mole cannon fires these on its own (Shots > KillerScene is this scene by default); one placed in a level flies off the way it faces (+Z) at launch speed, levels out, and chases you when it sees you within 40 m. Plain (black) ones fly past; a Homing one (Kind) turns after you and dives; a Gold one (Kind, or 1 in 20 by chance) is worth 8 coins. It blows up on anything it touches -- a wall, the ground, another enemy, you (3 HP, the fire knock) -- and after 25 s of chasing it sinks and blows. Spray it: two coins (eight gold) and it bursts harmlessly. Stomp it: you bounce and it drops to the ground and blows there. Knobs: Kind, Deviations (SpeedScale, RollSw = the game's unused body roll in the chase, TrampleDie), Effects (the blast, the smoke trail / water and sand column slots, the coin), Sounds (two slots)."

